st, and Fernest is losing badly. When Olivia shows up on Fernest's doorstep with a sack of imperial heads looking to volunteer, the royal army happily welcomes her into its ranks. Thanks to Z's training, she quickly proves herself as a ferocious warrior. In fact, she might be just what Fernest needs to turn the tide of the war... but will they accept her lack of people skills and disregard for discipline? And will she ever see Z again?\n___\n[Official English Light Novel](https://j-novel.club/series/death-s-daughter-and-the-ebony-blade)","year":2019,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Comedy","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/12e28a8a-cbfe-4e12-bab8-b6fb0b9a59b4/2e9341cc-267d-487b-95e5-a00cd23a3c36.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","pt-br","fr","id","hu","es-la","ru"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.6,"follows":56778,"listAt":"2026-10-31T05:52:28.953Z","chapters":[{"id":"c87d398a-4720-4a9c-a25f-3e5157c70fed","number":"60.1","volume":null,"title":"The Essence of Magic ①","lang":"en","pages":7,"createdAt":"2026-10-01T17:40:45+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"6d642873-6400-4214-8b9f-1f8164363339","number":"59","volume":null,"title":"Power of the Blaze","lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2026-08-11T14:20:33+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"81f4bc2f-4781-414c-909e-ac231dd97fa0","number":"58.2","volume":null,"title":"Battle of the Ballroom ②","lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2026-07-10T19:42:52+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"978360bb-e8d3-456a-b010-b5c5cb0a6e21","number":"58.1","volume":null,"title":"Battle of the Ballroom ①","lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2026-06-11T18:52:57+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"d97d0cfe-08b1-429c-b82a-e4ae2fe45172","number":"57.2","volume":null,"title":"Royal Audience ②","lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2026-05-10T17:47:37+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"ee8c0a00-30f2-4937-8691-bf294a6b737c","number":"57.1","volume":null,"title":"Royal Audience ①","lang":"en","pa